Third-party notes: this mod compiles against the Simple Voice Chat plugin API
(de.maxhenkel.voicechat:voicechat-api) as a compile-only dependency; none of that
API's code is bundled in the released jar. The release jar additionally bundles the
ffmpeg (LGPL) and yt-dlp (Unlicense) executables, which it runs as separate
processes. Their notices and full license texts are included inside the
release jar under jockey_radio/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and jockey_radio/licenses/.
